*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0042
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-02-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 175
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP030
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0042.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY FRD0042C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> HOLD TRANSACTION FLAG
    05 WS-HLD             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 WS-RVF             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 RVF-REVIEW-NEEDED VALUE 'Y'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CHECK-CHANNEL
    DISPLAY "WS-HLD=" WS-HLD
    DISPLAY "WS-RVF=" WS-RVF
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-CHANNEL.
    IF CH-ONLINE
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> CARD-NOT-PRESENT ONLINE PURCHASE
            WHEN CPF-NOT-PRESENT AND T-AMT1 > 750
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-HLD
                SET RVF-REVIEW-NEEDED TO TRUE
            WHEN T-AMT1 > 15000
                SET RVF-REVIEW-NEEDED TO TRUE
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO WS-HLD
    END-IF.
